# This project runs on Cloudflare Workers, so configuration is not read from a
# .env file at runtime. Every environment-specific value is stored as a secret.
#
# ── Production: set each value as a Worker secret (never committed) ───────────
#   npx wrangler secret put LEGACY_SITE_URL     # base URL of your Legacy Library site
#   npx wrangler secret put YCL_HOST            # digital assets host
#   npx wrangler secret put YCL_PROTOCOL        # https | http (optional; defaults to https)
#   npx wrangler secret put YCL_LIBRARY_SLUG    # your digital library slug
#   npx wrangler secret put YCL_AUTH_URL        # digital auth URL
#
# ── Local development: create a gitignored .dev.vars file (wrangler loads it) ──
#   LEGACY_SITE_URL=...
#   YCL_HOST=...
#   YCL_PROTOCOL=https
#   YCL_LIBRARY_SLUG=...
#   YCL_AUTH_URL=...
#
# ── Required bindings (declared in wrangler.jsonc) ─────────────────────────────
#   BROWSER       Browser Rendering binding
#   COOKIE_CACHE  KV namespace for cached login cookies
#                 create with: npx wrangler kv namespace create COOKIE_CACHE
